# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# compiled output
dist
tmp
.tmp
out-tsc
*.tsbuildinfo
.next
.docusaurus
apps/docs-public/build/
apps/anvil-docs-private/build/
packages/anvil/core/patterns/

# dependencies
node_modules
package-lock.json
# ATTRIB-015 exception: tools/dev is isolated from the pnpm-workspace
# (license-checker@25.0.1 hoisting incompat) and installed via npm.
# Its lock file is checked in for reproducible Node attribution
# output — without it, license-checker's transitive can shift between
# runs and trip the acknowledgements freshness gate.
!tools/dev/package-lock.json

